// error: what is passed for `value` of `Mutex` may use only sendable values from around it, but it uses `b`, a `Buffer[int]`, which is mutable; an immutable copy (`toVector`) is sendable
// error: `Buffer[int]` does not conform to `Sendable`, the bound of `R` in `with`: it is mutable; an immutable copy (`toVector`) is sendable
// error: what is passed for `body` of `Mutex.with` may use only sendable values from around it, but it uses `leak`, a `Buffer[int]`, which is mutable; an immutable copy (`toVector`) is sendable
